&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Stay ahead of SMB landscape trends, competitive dynamics, and evolving customer challenges to continuously refine your sales approach and inform internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
