&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coordinate photographers, stylists,&amp;nbsp;retouchers, and producers, and establish KPIs and reporting to track throughput, turnaround,&amp;nbsp;utilization, and quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own and continuously improve end-to-end studio workflows, using production data and bottleneck analysis to&amp;nbsp;eliminate&amp;nbsp;inefficiencies and drive scalable ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
